{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】佐敦德成街爆水管，高景臺及康源閣兩屋苑三座大廈供水受影響。</p>\n<p>大量食水不斷湧出路面，施工位置冒起小湧泉。水務署下午在德成街維修鹹水管期間，在工程範圍內的一條食水管突然爆裂，水務署人員隨即關閉水掣搶修。受事故影響，附近兩屋苑高景臺及康源閣三座大廈食水供應需要暫停。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:10.887052+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:17:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:22.043650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:58:35.442824+00:00","content_hash":"e4af99151c932b26aa4664571abeebb6caad59bca520d6020db6d8d336dd5495","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:10.887052+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}